  "summary": {
    "kind": "quote",
    "span": {
      "end": 2593,
      "end_line": 25,
      "line": 25,
      "start": 2180
    },
    "text": "Over three Councils (`t_0002`, `t_0003`, `t_0004`, 2026-11-19 and 2026-11-20) every seat on the Gemini family failed, and each Council still printed \"two families met\". This spec says how Delphi stops a Gemini-carried seat from being sent more than its carrier delivers, keeps the task readable when something is cut anyway, counts a family only when a seat was heard, and keeps a seat from acting on the project."
  }
